<title>USA: Chateau Communities recent merger tax-free.</title>
<headline>Chateau Communities recent merger tax-free.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chateau Communities Inc said Wednesday the recent merger between Chateau Properties Inc and ROC Communities Inc was a tax free exchange.</p>
<p>Chateau also said it was substantially tax free to the limited partners of CP LP who participated in the transaction.</p>
<p>Chateau said it received a private letter ruling from the Internal Revenue Service on the issue.</p>
<p>The $365 million merger created the nation's largest mobile home park operator.</p>
<p>Chateau is a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
